<title>JAPAN: Nippon Foil -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Foil -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to May 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.54		vs	   11.16</p>
<p> Operating	  285    million    vs	  330    million</p>
<p> Current	    295    million    vs	  324    million</p>
<p> Net		   84    million    vs	  154    million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.54 yen	  vs	    7.05 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  22 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Foil Mfg Co Ltd is a specialist manufacturer of aluminium foils.</p>
